{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>A QUEST FOR VENGEANCE!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631070/extras/d6fa320948051de1c477eaac18a9ece6.poster.avif?t=1759198712\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631070/extras/d6fa320948051de1c477eaac18a9ece6.webm?t=1759198712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631070/extras/d6fa320948051de1c477eaac18a9ece6.mp4?t=1759198712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the humans destroy his dam, one beaver launches a crusade of wanton destruction! Wield the weapons of humanity against them, destroying their cities in a series of missions escalating in difficulty.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>AN ENGINE OF TERROR!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631070/extras/21bb5fa97466c3b82bd8bf685b080584.poster.avif?t=1759198712\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631070/extras/21bb5fa97466c3b82bd8bf685b080584.webm?t=1759198712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631070/extras/21bb5fa97466c3b82bd8bf685b080584.mp4?t=1759198712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your bulldozer is your greatest weapon! Plow through buildings and enemy hordes alike, leaving only smoke and ash in your wake. Use the scrap you acquire to repair your bulldozer and fortify its defenses!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>A MENAGERIE OF MAYHEM!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631070/extras/9eda79521823e3b7f0cbec4d4ddb5745.poster.avif?t=1759198712\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631070/extras/9eda79521823e3b7f0cbec4d4ddb5745.webm?t=1759198712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631070/extras/9eda79521823e3b7f0cbec4d4ddb5745.mp4?t=1759198712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new playable animals, each with their own unique skills! Synergize your animal abilities with your weapon and upgrade choices\u00a0to deliver maximum carnage!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>AN EVER-EVOLVING ARSENAL!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631070/extras/867e18611511eaf10773e804d02331c5.poster.avif?t=1759198712\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631070/extras/867e18611511eaf10773e804d02331c5.webm?t=1759198712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631070/extras/867e18611511eaf10773e804d02331c5.mp4?t=1759198712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your enemies grow in strength and number, you'll need to adapt to survive! Acquire new weapons on your journey, and enhance them with game-changing upgrades. Complete challenges to unlock new weapons that will appear in your runs!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3631070?t=1759198712","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c